{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-query-languages","title":"图查询语言：Cypher、Gremlin 与 SPARQL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/fundamentals/graph-query-languages","wordCount":1368,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"图查询语言-cypher-gremlin-与-sparql\">图查询语言：Cypher、Gremlin 与 SPARQL</h1><p>图查询语言是开发者与图数据库交互的接口层，其设计哲学直接影响代码可读性、查询表达力和执行效率。图数据库世界目前存在三种主流查询语言：<strong>Cypher</strong>（声明式，LPG）、<strong>Gremlin</strong>（命令式，LPG）和 <strong>SPARQL</strong>（声明式，RDF）。理解它们的差异有助于在不同场景下做出合理的技术选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cypher</td>\n<td>Neo4j 创建的声明式图查询语言，用 ASCII art 风格直观表达图模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gremlin</td>\n<td>Apache TinkerPop 的命令式图遍历语言，以步骤链表达图操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPARQL</td>\n<td>W3C 标准化的 RDF 查询语言，基于三元组模式匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MATCH</td>\n<td>Cypher 的核心子句，用模式匹配图结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行计划</td>\n<td>查询引擎生成的物理操作树，EXPLAIN/PROFILE 可查看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历步骤（Step）</td>\n<td>Gremlin 的基本执行单元，包括过滤步、移动步、转换步等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cypher-模式匹配的声明式语言\">Cypher：模式匹配的声明式语言</h2><p>Cypher 由 Neo4j 团队创建，其最大设计亮点是用 <strong>ASCII art 风格</strong>直观表达图模式，让查询语句本身就像是图的可视化表示。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心语法\">核心语法</h3><p>Cypher 的基本查询结构是 <code>MATCH...WHERE...RETURN</code>，类似 SQL 的 <code>FROM...WHERE...SELECT</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 查找所有名为 Alice 的人认识的演员&#10;MATCH (alice:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(friend:Person)&#10;      -[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(movie:Movie)&#10;WHERE movie.year &gt; 2010&#10;RETURN friend.name AS actor_name,&#10;       movie.title AS movie_title,&#10;       movie.year AS year&#10;ORDER BY year DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查找所有名为 Alice 的人认识的演员</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (alice:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS]->(friend:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:ACTED_IN]->(movie:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE movie.year > 2010</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friend.name AS actor_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       movie.title AS movie_title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       movie.year AS year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY year DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><p>图模式的语法规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点</strong>：用圆括号 <code>(n:Label {prop: value})</code></li>\n<li><strong>边</strong>：用方括号 <code>[r:TYPE {prop: value}]</code> 配合箭头 <code>--&gt;</code> 或 <code>&lt;--</code></li>\n<li><strong>可变长路径</strong>：<code>(a)-[:KNOWS*1..3]-&gt;(b)</code> 表示 1 到 3 跳的 KNOWS 关系</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"数据修改语句\">数据修改语句</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- CREATE：创建节点和关系&#10;CREATE (p:Person {name: &#39;Charlie&#39;, age: 28})&#10;CREATE (p)-[:KNOWS {since: date(&#39;2024-01-01&#39;)}]-&gt;(q:Person {name: &#39;David&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- MERGE：幂等的 upsert 操作&#10;MERGE (p:Person {email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;})&#10;ON CREATE SET p.name = &#39;Alice&#39;, p.created = timestamp()&#10;ON MATCH SET p.lastSeen = timestamp()&#10;&#10;-- SET / REMOVE：更新属性和标签&#10;MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;SET p.age = 31, p:VIP&#10;REMOVE p.tempFlag\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- CREATE：创建节点和关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p:Person {name: 'Charlie', age: 28})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:KNOWS {since: date('2024-01-01')}]->(q:Person {name: 'David'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- MERGE：幂等的 upsert 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MERGE (p:Person {email: 'alice@example.com'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ON CREATE SET p.name = 'Alice', p.created = timestamp()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ON MATCH SET p.lastSeen = timestamp()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- SET / REMOVE：更新属性和标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SET p.age = 31, p:VIP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>REMOVE p.tempFlag</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"高级查询模式\">高级查询模式</h3><p><strong>可选匹配（OPTIONAL MATCH）</strong>：相当于 SQL LEFT JOIN，即使模式不匹配也返回空值而非空行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:MANAGES]-&gt;(report:Person)&#10;RETURN p.name, collect(report.name) AS reports\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:MANAGES]->(report:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p.name, collect(report.name) AS reports</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>WITH 子句</strong>：在查询管道中传递结果，允许在中间阶段进行过滤、聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"MATCH (p:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(m:Movie)&#10;WITH p, count(m) AS movie_count&#10;WHERE movie_count &gt; 5&#10;RETURN p.name, movie_count&#10;ORDER BY movie_count DESC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(m:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH p, count(m) AS movie_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE movie_count > 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p.name, movie_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY movie_count DESC</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CALL 子查询</strong>：调用过程或执行嵌套查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"MATCH (p:Person)&#10;CALL {&#10;    WITH p&#10;    MATCH (p)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(m:Movie)&#10;    RETURN count(m) AS mc&#10;}&#10;RETURN p.name, mc\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    WITH p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    MATCH (p)-[:ACTED_IN]->(m:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    RETURN count(m) AS mc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p.name, mc</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"查询计划与优化\">查询计划与优化</h3><p>Cypher 查询引擎会将查询编译成<strong>执行计划（Execution Plan）</strong>，可通过 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 或 <code>PROFILE</code> 查看：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-&gt;(friends:Person)&#10;RETURN friends.name, length(path) AS hops\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS*1..3]->(friends:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friends.name, length(path) AS hops</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行计划的关键节点类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计划节点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NodeByLabelScan</td>\n<td>全扫描某标签的所有节点</td>\n<td>无匹配索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NodeIndexSeek</td>\n<td>通过索引定位节点</td>\n<td>有等值索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NodeIndexSeekByRange</td>\n<td>通过范围索引定位</td>\n<td>有范围索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RelationshipByTypeScan</td>\n<td>全扫描某类型的关系</td>\n<td>无起始节点锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expand</td>\n<td>从已知节点展开邻接关系</td>\n<td>正常图遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter</td>\n<td>过滤行</td>\n<td>WHERE 条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Projection</td>\n<td>选择输出列</td>\n<td>RETURN 子句</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>优化原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>总是从高选择性的节点开始（如通过 ID 或唯一索引定位）</li>\n<li>尽早过滤（WHERE 条件靠前放）</li>\n<li>避免笛卡尔积（多个独立的 MATCH 语句会产生笛卡尔积）</li>\n<li>对高基数属性创建索引</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"gremlin-图遍历的命令式语言\">Gremlin：图遍历的命令式语言</h2><p>Gremlin 是 Apache TinkerPop 项目的图遍历语言，采用<strong>命令式</strong>（procedure）风格，将查询表达为一系列图遍历步骤（step）的链式调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[图遍历机 GraphTraversal] --&gt;|步骤链| B[起始步 V/E]&#10;    B --&gt;|过滤步 has/filter| C[过滤]&#10;    C --&gt;|移动步 out/in/both| D[邻接遍历]&#10;    D --&gt;|转换步 values/project| E[结果投影]&#10;    E --&gt;|终止步 toList/next| F[结果]\">graph LR\n    A[图遍历机 GraphTraversal] --&gt;|步骤链| B[起始步 V/E]\n    B --&gt;|过滤步 has/filter| C[过滤]\n    C --&gt;|移动步 out/in/both| D[邻接遍历]\n    D --&gt;|转换步 values/project| E[结果投影]\n    E --&gt;|终止步 toList/next| F[结果]</pre><h3 id=\"gremlin-基础语法\">Gremlin 基础语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"groovy\" data-code=\"// 使用 Gremlin Console（Groovy 语法）&#10;&#10;// 查找 Alice 认识的所有朋友&#10;g.V().has(&#39;Person&#39;, &#39;name&#39;, &#39;Alice&#39;)&#10; .out(&#39;KNOWS&#39;)&#10; .values(&#39;name&#39;)&#10; .toList()&#10;&#10;// 等价的 Cypher 查询：&#10;// MATCH (:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(f:Person)&#10;// RETURN f.name&#10;&#10;// 查找 Alice 朋友的朋友，排除 Alice 自己&#10;g.V().has(&#39;Person&#39;, &#39;name&#39;, &#39;Alice&#39;).as(&#39;a&#39;)&#10; .out(&#39;KNOWS&#39;).out(&#39;KNOWS&#39;)&#10; .where(neq(&#39;a&#39;))&#10; .dedup()&#10; .values(&#39;name&#39;)&#10; .toList()&#10;&#10;// 过滤 + 投影&#10;g.V().hasLabel(&#39;Person&#39;)&#10; .has(&#39;age&#39;, gt(25))&#10; .project(&#39;name&#39;, &#39;age&#39;, &#39;movieCount&#39;)&#10;   .by(&#39;name&#39;)&#10;   .by(&#39;age&#39;)&#10;   .by(out(&#39;ACTED_IN&#39;).count())&#10; .order().by(select(&#39;movieCount&#39;), desc)&#10; .limit(10)&#10; .toList()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 Gremlin Console（Groovy 语法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查找 Alice 认识的所有朋友</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.V().has('Person', 'name', 'Alice')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .out('KNOWS')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .values('name')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 等价的 Cypher 查询：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// MATCH (:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS]->(f:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// RETURN f.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查找 Alice 朋友的朋友，排除 Alice 自己</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.V().has('Person', 'name', 'Alice').as('a')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .out('KNOWS').out('KNOWS')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .where(neq('a'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .dedup()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .values('name')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 过滤 + 投影</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.V().hasLabel('Person')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .has('age', gt(25))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .project('name', 'age', 'movieCount')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   .by('name')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   .by('age')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   .by(out('ACTED_IN').count())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .order().by(select('movieCount'), desc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .limit(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .toList()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gremlin-的关键步骤\">Gremlin 的关键步骤</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤类别</th>\n<th>代表步骤</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起始步</td>\n<td><code>V()</code>, <code>E()</code></td>\n<td>从所有节点/边开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤步</td>\n<td><code>has()</code>, <code>where()</code>, <code>filter()</code></td>\n<td>条件过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动步</td>\n<td><code>out()</code>, <code>in()</code>, <code>both()</code>, <code>outE()</code></td>\n<td>图遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换步</td>\n<td><code>values()</code>, <code>project()</code>, <code>map()</code></td>\n<td>数据转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合步</td>\n<td><code>count()</code>, <code>sum()</code>, <code>group()</code></td>\n<td>聚合计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径步</td>\n<td><code>path()</code>, <code>simplePath()</code></td>\n<td>路径信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支步</td>\n<td><code>choose()</code>, <code>union()</code>, <code>coalesce()</code></td>\n<td>条件分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止步</td>\n<td><code>toList()</code>, <code>next()</code>, <code>iterate()</code></td>\n<td>执行遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"gremlin-vs-cypher-的选型考虑\">Gremlin vs Cypher 的选型考虑</h3><p>Gremlin 的优势在于<strong>程序化控制</strong>：可以用宿主语言（Java/Python/JavaScript）的控制流与遍历步骤结合，实现复杂的动态查询逻辑。适用场景：TinkerPop 兼容的数据库（Amazon Neptune、JanusGraph）、需要在应用代码中动态构建复杂遍历逻辑。</p>\n<p>Cypher 的优势在于<strong>可读性</strong>：图模式一目了然，数据分析师也能快速理解。适用场景：Neo4j 生态、数据探查和 BI 查询、团队成员不熟悉函数式编程风格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sparql-rdf-的声明式查询语言\">SPARQL：RDF 的声明式查询语言</h2><p>SPARQL 是 W3C 标准化的 RDF 查询语言，以**三元组模式（Triple Pattern）**为核心构建查询。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sparql-基础查询\">SPARQL 基础查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sparql\" data-code=\"PREFIX ex: &lt;http://example.org/&gt;&#10;PREFIX schema: &lt;http://schema.org/&gt;&#10;&#10;-- SELECT 查询：返回绑定变量的表格结果&#10;SELECT ?actorName ?movieTitle ?year&#10;WHERE {&#10;    ex:alice schema:knows ?friend .&#10;    ?friend schema:actedIn ?movie .&#10;    ?friend schema:name ?actorName .&#10;    ?movie schema:name ?movieTitle .&#10;    ?movie schema:datePublished ?year .&#10;    FILTER (?year &gt; 2010)&#10;}&#10;ORDER BY DESC(?year)&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PREFIX ex: &#x3C;http://example.org/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PREFIX schema: &#x3C;http://schema.org/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- SELECT 查询：返回绑定变量的表格结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SELECT ?actorName ?movieTitle ?year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ex:alice schema:knows ?friend .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?friend schema:actedIn ?movie .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?friend schema:name ?actorName .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?movie schema:name ?movieTitle .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?movie schema:datePublished ?year .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FILTER (?year > 2010)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY DESC(?year)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sparql-查询形式\">SPARQL 查询形式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SELECT</td>\n<td>返回变量绑定的表格</td>\n<td>数据查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONSTRUCT</td>\n<td>返回新的 RDF 图</td>\n<td>图变换、数据导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASK</td>\n<td>返回 true/false</td>\n<td>模式存在性检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DESCRIBE</td>\n<td>返回实体的相关三元组</td>\n<td>实体探查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"sparql-的-optional-和-union\">SPARQL 的 OPTIONAL 和 UNION</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sparql\" data-code=\"SELECT ?name ?email ?phone&#10;WHERE {&#10;    ?person a schema:Person ;&#10;            schema:name ?name .&#10;    OPTIONAL { ?person schema:email ?email }&#10;    OPTIONAL { ?person schema:telephone ?phone }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SELECT ?name ?email ?phone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?person a schema:Person ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            schema:name ?name .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    OPTIONAL { ?person schema:email ?email }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    OPTIONAL { ?person schema:telephone ?phone }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sparql-的推理集成\">SPARQL 的推理集成</h3><p>SPARQL 引擎可以结合 RDFS/OWL 推理，使查询能「看到」推导出的三元组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sparql\" data-code=\"-- 假设 OWL 定义了 Employee 是 Person 的子类&#10;-- 查询所有 Person（包括推导出来的 Employee 实例）&#10;SELECT ?person ?name&#10;WHERE {&#10;    ?person a schema:Person ;&#10;            schema:name ?name .&#10;}&#10;-- 如果启用了推理，Employee 实例也会出现\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 假设 OWL 定义了 Employee 是 Person 的子类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查询所有 Person（包括推导出来的 Employee 实例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SELECT ?person ?name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ?person a schema:Person ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            schema:name ?name .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 如果启用了推理，Employee 实例也会出现</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"三种语言的总体对比\">三种语言的总体对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Cypher</th>\n<th>Gremlin</th>\n<th>SPARQL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范式</td>\n<td>声明式（模式匹配）</td>\n<td>命令式（遍历链）</td>\n<td>声明式（三元组模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用模型</td>\n<td>LPG</td>\n<td>LPG（TinkerPop）</td>\n<td>RDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达力</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准化</td>\n<td>GQL（ISO 2024）</td>\n<td>TinkerPop（事实标准）</td>\n<td>W3C 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理支持</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>RDFS/OWL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表数据库</td>\n<td>Neo4j, Memgraph</td>\n<td>Neptune, JanusGraph</td>\n<td>Stardog, Virtuoso</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>三种图查询语言各有其设计目标和适用场景：Cypher 以直观的图模式语法著称，最适合 Neo4j 生态和数据探查；Gremlin 提供极高的遍历表达力，是 TinkerPop 生态（Neptune、JanusGraph）的标准语言；SPARQL 服务于 RDF 知识图谱，携带完整语义推理能力。GQL 国际标准的发布正在推动 Cypher 和 openCypher 社区走向统一，长期来看图查询语言的碎片化问题将逐步改善。工程实践中，选择查询语言与选择数据库平台密不可分，应作为一个整体决策来考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>图数据模型：LPG 与 RDF 的设计原理和选型指南</li>\n<li>图存储引擎：不同存储实现对查询性能的影响</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图查询语言：Cypher、Gremlin 与 SPARQL","id":"图查询语言-cypher-gremlin-与-sparql"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cypher：模式匹配的声明式语言","id":"cypher-模式匹配的声明式语言"},{"level":3,"text":"核心语法","id":"核心语法"},{"level":3,"text":"数据修改语句","id":"数据修改语句"},{"level":3,"text":"高级查询模式","id":"高级查询模式"},{"level":3,"text":"查询计划与优化","id":"查询计划与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Gremlin：图遍历的命令式语言","id":"gremlin-图遍历的命令式语言"},{"level":3,"text":"Gremlin 基础语法","id":"gremlin-基础语法"},{"level":3,"text":"Gremlin 的关键步骤","id":"gremlin-的关键步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"Gremlin vs Cypher 的选型考虑","id":"gremlin-vs-cypher-的选型考虑"},{"level":2,"text":"SPARQL：RDF 的声明式查询语言","id":"sparql-rdf-的声明式查询语言"},{"level":3,"text":"SPARQL 基础查询","id":"sparql-基础查询"},{"level":3,"text":"SPARQL 查询形式","id":"sparql-查询形式"},{"level":3,"text":"SPARQL 的 OPTIONAL 和 UNION","id":"sparql-的-optional-和-union"},{"level":3,"text":"SPARQL 的推理集成","id":"sparql-的推理集成"},{"level":2,"text":"三种语言的总体对比","id":"三种语言的总体对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"图数据模型：LPG 与 RDF 的设计哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/fundamentals/graph-data-models"},"next":{"title":"图存储引擎：原生图存储与关系后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/fundamentals/graph-storage-engines"}}